WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.160
Portland won't help ICE pick up bad hombres,

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:05.400
but they'll help Antifa.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.800
Christy Noon sat down with Bob and had a word this afternoon,

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.160
and by the looks of it,

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.600
Bob didn't seem very happy with the way the meeting went.

